<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post8848955819126412134..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Speak No Ill of the County Dictator</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>6</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2363198771245534143</id><published>2010-10-16T12:14:14.651-06:00</published><updated>2010-10-16T12:14:14.651-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Friends,&#xa;  There is a monstrous conspiracy co...</title><content type='html'>Dear Friends,&lt;br /&gt;  There is a monstrous conspiracy corrupting and destroying our government.  Look up the video of Congressman McDonald from 1983 on youtube.  Look at what happened to him shortly thereafter.  We must Strike the Root.  These evil criminals must be shut down and put away.&lt;br /&gt;  What is most sad, however, is that part of their scheme for global conquest involved corrupting the morals of the everyday citizens.  We will see more and more of the result of this corruption.  What Hollywood puts out is no accident...and the resulting low moral standards of the average citizen is no accident.  I fear that the majority have been corrupted through their schemes, and I fear that the majority cannot be counted on to correct this enormous problem.&lt;br /&gt;   Let us expect and prepare for the worst.  But let us also expect victory.  We must act now, and phase one of our strategy must be to expose the slimy octopus whose tentacles are wrapt around our planet.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/2363198771245534143'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/2363198771245534143'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html?showComment=1287252854651#c2363198771245534143' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8848955819126412134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8848955819126412134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1473618236"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 16, 2010 at 12:14 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4301238160665638180</id><published>2010-10-16T10:25:43.390-06:00</published><updated>2010-10-16T10:25:43.390-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When things get ugly around here, these scum cops ...</title><content type='html'>When things get ugly around here, these scum cops will get their due. I predict the old practices of tar and feathering, and even dry-gulching, are going to make a big comeback.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In the meantime, it looks like Leonard got what every publicist wants: free publicity, and lots of it, courtesy of the Lake County PD. Look at the bright side...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/4301238160665638180'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/4301238160665638180'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html?showComment=1287246343390#c4301238160665638180' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8848955819126412134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8848955819126412134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-98925939"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 16, 2010 at 10:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4482249622400198740</id><published>2010-10-08T18:39:50.713-06:00</published><updated>2010-10-08T18:39:50.713-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I am posting this message anonymously because afte...</title><content type='html'>I am posting this message anonymously because after finding my already privatized Social Security account at Fidelity Investments, and having matching deposit information from the SSA dated 1991, and figuring out who done it, I have been stalked out of my home, followed, harassed, humiliated, financially raped and more.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Americans need to wake up. Our country is long gone. We live in a brand new world order where evil politicans have conspired to put the little man down.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;they are winning</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/4482249622400198740'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/4482249622400198740'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html?showComment=1286584790713#c4482249622400198740' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8848955819126412134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8848955819126412134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1633309369"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 8, 2010 at 6:39 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3814269271921627005</id><published>2010-10-08T17:59:05.484-06:00</published><updated>2010-10-08T17:59:05.484-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another solid article, Will.</title><content type='html'>Another solid article, Will.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/3814269271921627005'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/3814269271921627005'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html?showComment=1286582345484#c3814269271921627005' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8848955819126412134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8848955819126412134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 8, 2010 at 5:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2473504584597119199</id><published>2010-10-08T05:11:35.066-06:00</published><updated>2010-10-08T05:11:35.066-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I remember sitting in the visitor&amp;#39;s gallery in...</title><content type='html'>I remember sitting in the visitor&amp;#39;s gallery in the South African Parliament in Cape Town, in February 1995, (Nelson Mandela was only about 60 feet away from me,) and hearing delegate Mac Maharaj give a speech about why that country was sinking into anarchy and lawlessness. He said, referring to the recently deposed Apartheid regime, that: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;When those who make the law and are supposed to uphold the law rountinely break the law, it creates in the common people a contempt, not only for the ruling regime, but for the law itself.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;He continued: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;The law is now seen, after so many years of perversion of the law in the service of corruption and violence, as a system which only protects lawbreakers, and the mere mention of &amp;#39;The Law&amp;#39; today provokes the victims of the regime and its so-called &amp;#39;Laws&amp;#39; to fury and disgust.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We in America should take note. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Today in South Africa, those who have anything worth stealing live behind 10-foot walls topped with razor wire, with broken glass cemented to the top, and enter their compounds through heavy steel gates, often with armed private security guards minding them. The police literally will do nothing about street crime, store robberies, carjackings and holdups - they are mortally afraid of the criminals, who rob, rape,  plunder and kill with impunity. You will see your rapist or mugger walking in the street, and he will smile at you, calm in the knowledge that you can do nothing to him - if you call the police, nothing will happen to him except that he will lay in wait a few nights later to kill you as you return to your razor-wire fortress.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Behold our future in America. All that is necessary for evil to triumph is that good men do nothing.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is not a small thing that we are witnessing. It is more than some corrupt small-town prosecutor and police department. Much more. We are, all of us, living through the death of the American Dream, the death of the Ideals of the Founding Fathers, the death of everything decent, good, and noble, that ever inspired this country to be an example to the world.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The beauty of our founding ideals, that men could govern themselves with justice and compassion, and which inspired so many nations to breathe deeply the air of freedom, has become a vile cesspool of corruption, murder, oppression, viciousness, casual violence, and selfish greed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I think, next July 4th, I will sew a wide black border around the American flag, and fly THAT from my front porch. Instead of Francis Scott Key&amp;#39;s Stars and Stripes, I will play Chopin&amp;#39;s Funeral March, as a requiem for our Republic.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;- Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/2473504584597119199'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/2473504584597119199'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html?showComment=1286536295066#c2473504584597119199' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8848955819126412134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8848955819126412134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 8, 2010 at 5:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6629249944423394142</id><published>2010-10-07T21:28:00.395-06:00</published><updated>2010-10-07T21:28:00.395-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I have your blog linked on the The Freemen P...</title><content type='html'>Will, I have your blog linked on the The Freemen Project. Come take a look sometime.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We are going to have a rally in Houston on Nov 13 of this year. This will mark the beginning of an offensive movement that will inevitably draw in the millions of angry countrymen scattered across this country.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If you have any possibility of making it down here, we&amp;#39;d be honored to have you as a speaker to address the Freemen.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/6629249944423394142'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8848955819126412134/comments/default/6629249944423394142'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html?showComment=1286508480395#c6629249944423394142' title=''/><author><name>BlackDak22</name><uri>http://www.thefreemenproject.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/10/speak-no-ill-of-county-dictator.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8848955819126412134' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8848955819126412134' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-438530670"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 7, 2010 at 9:28 PM"/></entry></feed>